{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028010/extras/bf90b738dee93cbd45952a1094cb47f9.avif?t=1772418612\" width=780 height=78 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remy, a demon lord who neglected her duties and led a life of laziness, faced betrayal from her subordinates. Unable to tolerate her idle behavior any longer, they cast a &quot;Weakening Curse&quot; on her and threw her out of the Demon Castle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To lift the &quot;Weakening Curse,&quot; Remy needs to collect four &quot;Stones of Dispel,&quot; each held by one of her subordinates. Determined to break the curse and reclaim the Demon Castle, she embarks on a challenging quest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will Remy manage to lift the curse and return to her leisurely life once more? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028010/extras/921dd3392b59aeca3e3eb6fbd8dc71b4.avif?t=1772418612\" width=780 height=78 /></span>This game is an action RPG. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players control Remy, utilizing various skills to fight through monsters and conquer the dungeon-like Demon Castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3028010/extras/1b9b4f04454c73e12aafcb8a562baf05.avif?t=1772418612\" width=780 height=78 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action RPG</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide array of skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable controls</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3028010?t=1772418612","background_raw":"https://store.ak